<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 406 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 406 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 196 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills and for 210 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills against the National Bank of Poland's 300 million zloty combined offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
